# CockroachDB Scripts

Those scripts are written to use CockroachDB's internal benchmarks to test the YCSB workload.

They add simulated geo-latencies.

## How to use

You can use them with the main script:
```
./cockroach_ycsb.sh -h
```
This will write the usage that show every parameters

## Default Settings

By default it launches 3 nodes using docker, called roach1 roach2 and roach3 as well as a docker network called roachnet and a volume per node.

The default workload is workload C that runs for 5 minutes.

To change the latencies just change the configuration file.


## Output

The output is captured and put into roach_i.log
